WEBVTT

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.860
Though my true power
has been unleashed,

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.490
you are still able to keep up.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:45.830
Yeah.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:48.150
You're pretty strong, too.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:59.060
Putting City A back together
might be impossible.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:03.720
Well, right now I should be
focusing on the battle.

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:06.240
She may be rank 2 or whatever,

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:09.040
but I can't leave it to one little girl.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:12.910
I got my own ways of
fighting enemies in the air.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.450
Like this!

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:22.930
Hey!

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:25.790
What do you think you're doing?

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:29.040
This area's got some nice rubble.

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:31.280
Hurry up and get out of my way.

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:34.300
She's using her psychic power?!

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:35.850
I give up!

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.690
We're under attack again!

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:49.970
Return fire!

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:52.270
The guns are jacked!

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:54.270
Seriously?! We're dead meat!

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.510
This planet's too tough!

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:58.400
Lord Boros!

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:00.730
I wanna go home...

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.630
Such incredible power.

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:09.710
Tornado may actually
bring it down on her own.

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:11.890
I have errands to run.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.790
I will head out now.

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:16.340
Things appear to be under control.

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.460
Well, do whatever you like.{Sure, go ahead.}

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.620
Some heroes have already left.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.810
Before I go, Genos, do you have a minute?{have you got a second?}

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:26.800
There's something I wish to tell you.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:29.800
Drive Knight, Class S, rank 9.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:31.760
This is a first...

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:36.500
Listen. Metal Knight is your "enemy."

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.590
Be careful.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.580
What are you implying?{What do you mean by that?}

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:42.440
You will know soon enough.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:45.880
But for now, stay away from him.

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:06.760
Bastard.

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:09.450
You sure make things interesting.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.150
I'm beginning to taste victory.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.170
The stiffness in my shoulders is gone.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.190
But I suppose I'm a little rusty.

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:21.710
Bastard, you're still—?

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:24.660
Hey. Forget something?

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:28.530
ATOMIC

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:28.530
SLASH

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.740
Atomic Slash!

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.080
Insolence...

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.630
Such complete insolence!

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:40.190
You move your heart-thing around
your body to hide its location.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:44.120
But your regeneration always
begins with your head

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.590
and in the center lies...

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:48.600
...your heart.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:52.660
After seeing it so much,
even a monkey'd figure it out.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.560
See? Checkmate.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:56.490
Noooooo!

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:01.910
Silverfang!

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:04.730
All I needed was one more swing.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:08.740
Keep your hands to yourself,
Silverfang.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:13.240
Goodness, I really do need
to do more full-body workouts.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.510
We got all the heads.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:20.050
That means...victory is ours!

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:23.630
Yah, but there's still that
big-ass ship up there.

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:31.560
All right, this is the last of
the reported survivors.

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:33.060
Let's move!

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:34.170
Right.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:40.860
Mumen!

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.970
Quit your staring and come on!

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.380
Yeah, okay.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:58.040
One punch

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.830
Three, Two, One, Kill shot

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:07.590
sanjou! Go on! seiseidoudou!!

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:07.590
I'm here! Go on! Fair and square!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:08.710
dou nattenda?

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:08.710
What's going on?

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:09.550
nanimo kanjinee?

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:09.550
I don't feel anything

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:11.170
mohaya teki inee!

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:11.170
There's no one to oppose me

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:15.090
Justice! shikkou! mondou muyou!

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:15.090
Justice! Enforcement! No point arguing about it!

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.800
ore ga tatsu!! aku o tatsu!!

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.800
I'll cut it off! Cut off evil!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.720
gasshou!!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.720
 Pray, Beg, Worship!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.720
®

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:22.730
Power, get power

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:26.270
adorenarin afuredasu ze!

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:26.270
Adrenaline's overflowin'!

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:29.980
Power, get power

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:34.990
kitaeta waza o buchikamase!

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:34.990
Strike with force with the technique I mastered

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:34.990
 µ

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:36.120
Hero

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:42.410
donna ni tsuyoi yatsu mo chippoke na gaki dattanda

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:42.410
Even the strongest
used to be little noobs

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.410
Nice moves.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.380
As I thought, you are strong.

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:43.500
Hero

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:46.560
Of all the myriad beings
I have fought, only you...

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:48.420
yowaki onore norikoe tsuyokunaru

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:48.420
They overcome their weaknesses
and become stronger

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.630
...survived this long!

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:49.750
Nobody knows who he is

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:53.800
kami yadoru kobushi kakagete

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:53.800
Raising my fists with gods dwelling in them

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:57.140
ore wa tsukisusumu dake sa

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:57.140
I'll just push onward

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:58.390
Now to release the
destructive energy held within me!

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:58.430
Hero

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:03.230
itsuka haiboku ni odei nameru made

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:03.230
until I taste the dirt
of defeat one day

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:03.440
Any normal creature hit by it
would find even their bones vaporized!

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:10.530
tatakau hero

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:10.530
A Fighting Hero

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:16.910
kodoku na hero

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:16.910
A Solitary Hero

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:13.240
I

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:13.900
I

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:14.570
I

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:15.450
I

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:16.160
I

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:16.950
Behind you!

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:16.700
I

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:22.750
I wanna be a saikyou hero!

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:22.750
I wanna be a Superhero!

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.000
You were a worthy opponent.

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:32.450
But the outcome
of this battle is clear.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:35.450
My species won
the struggle to survive

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.740
amidst the harsh environment
of our home world.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:42.380
We possess the ultimate
regenerative abilities.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:45.280
I, in particular,
have self-healing power,

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:49.700
physical prowess and latent energy
beyond your conception.

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.340
A deep wound that would
be fatal for you

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.400
heals itself on me in mere moments.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:57.360
By focusing all my energy
on my destroyed arm,

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:00.250
I can explosively speed up
the healing process.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.150
Good as new.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.870
You, on the other hand,
will only get injured more,

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:08.600
all while your stamina
gradually decreases—

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:09.540
Shut up.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:15.210
Blah, blah, blah. Aren't you done yet?{Are you done?}

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:16.860
With this?

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:24.730
No, not yet!

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:36.000
Meteoric Burst!

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:03.990
The energy shunted from my body
transforms into a propelling force,

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:08.050
elevating speed and power
to a level beyond the limitations...

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.970
...of living flesh!

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.290
Doing this places enormous stress on my body,

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.960
similar to anaerobic exercise.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:14.580
As a result, it shortens my life.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:15.890
Therefore, it should only be used as a

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:19.330
trump card for settling fights quickly.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:27.000
It's listing!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.880
You're doing it!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.740
Awesome, Tornado!

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:42.390
Oh.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:45.640
I made it.

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.110
This man...

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:56.030
...makes me want to go all out!

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.150
That's the way, Saitama.

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:20.810
You are indeed worth defeating!

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:23.540
Consecutive Normal Punches.

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.860
I will defeat you!

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:41.000
All my energy will be released,

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:46.140
blasting you and
this planet to Hell!

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:58.310
Collapsing Star, Roaring Cannon!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.900
In that case,
I'm using my final move too.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.140
Killer Move: Serious Series...

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.400
...Serious Punch.

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:42.220
Did I...lose?

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.030
You're still conscious?

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.920
You really are strong.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.120
The prophecy held true.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:55.260
The battle was...hard-fought.

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:58.380
Yeah. It sure was.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.010
You lie.

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:07.310
You had strength to spare.

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:10.210
I never stood a chance.

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:14.310
It wasn't even a battle.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.480
So much for prophecies.

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:23.160
You were too strong...

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:29.250
Saitama...

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:39.040
THE STRONGEST HERO

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:39.040
THE STRONGEST HERO

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:48.620
It's crashing?

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.180
Is this Master's doing?

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.690
We're done!
The power sphere's been broken!

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:56.710
We're going down!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.960
Lord Boros went wild!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.560
Get out, get out!

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.440
- Run!
- Stop shoving, stupid!

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:05.690
I wanna go home, Mommy!

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:07.740
It's coming down.

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:08.320
Huh?

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.890
Hey, we better get outta here...!

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:14.620
This is bad. Run for the Association HQ.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:16.780
Iai! Hold on to me!

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:18.160
I'm okay, Master!

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:21.850
Damn. When did Silverfang get so fast?

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:23.960
Now's not the time to be competitive.

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:25.570
Angel Dash!

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:28.580
Hey pansy, don't you run
in front of me! You're too slow!

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:29.790
Angel Dash!

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.230
Don't just say it, move!

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:35.790
- We're gonna crash!
- We're gonna crash!

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:46.850
It's down.

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:48.830
All right, let's go.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:14.680
How did City A end up like this?

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:18.640
CLASS A RANK 1

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:18.640
HANDSOME KAMEN AMAI MASK

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:17.910
All of Class S was meeting today...

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.260
Care to explain, Metal Bat?

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:26.270
Huh?

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.760
Explain it so I can understand.

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.960
Handsome Kamen Amai Mask...

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:34.900
Where the hell'd you pop up from?

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:38.410
I was filming a TV drama
in the next town.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:41.240
There was a roar and tremors,

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:45.230
so I came and
found City A wiped out.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.840
Monsters on a huge-ass ship
attacked us.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.730
They fired artillery at us
and did all this.

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.940
But we took care of it.

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:58.720
"Took care of it," you say?

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:01.300
You call this victory?

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:03.850
Such incompetence.

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:06.620
I'm completely appalled
at all of you!

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:07.810
Hey.

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:12.230
You didn't even get here in time,
so don't go acting all big.

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:15.130
It's true I didn't make it in time,

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:17.690
but you all were right here.

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:20.690
You didn't save a single brick!

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:24.540
We were having a meeting inside
the headquarters building.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.170
We went outside as soon as
the enemy attacked,

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.580
but the city was already in ruins.

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.340
So what?

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:36.530
You think if you tell them that,
the media will just let all this go?

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:37.590
You...

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.660
Whose side are you on?

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.890
We did our best.

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:45.140
I'm on the side of justice.

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:49.320
Having Class S heroes
this pathetic...

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:52.560
is an embarrassment.

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:56.520
Anybody this useless
should voluntarily retire.

00:15:56.880 --> 00:16:00.140
Hey! Don't start talking crap with us!

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:04.010
Who's gonna care about a pop idol with
a face busted all to Hell?!

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:07.660
Do you have any idea
why I don't move up to Class S?

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:11.040
I remain Class A, Rank 1
so I can prevent

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:15.560
weak, good-for-nothing pissants
like you from moving up to Class S.

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:32.730
Metal Knight, you skip the meeting
and only show up now?

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.570
This is...

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.380
magnificent!

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:41.760
Metal Knight!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.580
What are you doing here?

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:47.060
The battle is already over.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.580
Metal Knight is your "enemy."

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:52.740
Genos, right?

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:55.650
Do not tell me you have come
to recover the spaceship.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.140
Are you here

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.780
so you can create more powerful weapons
with the alien technology?

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:02.360
Precisely.

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:05.640
Powerful weapons
are a necessity...

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:07.810
for the sake of peace.

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:12.180
Even with powerful weapons,

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:14.520
in the hands of heroes like this,
they'd be wasted.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.850
You're mine later, pretty boy.
Watch your ass.

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.140
Hey!

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.770
I found some alien survivors!

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:28.060
I never thought Lord Boros would lose.{I thought Lord Boros could never lose.}

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:29.910
Are we going to be killed?

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:32.410
Maybe we can talk
our way out of this.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:35.180
Aggh, I'm so hungry!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.280
Idiot! Now's not the time for—

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.150
Shh! Someone's coming.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:50.020
Amai Mask! What the—?

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:53.560
They did not deserve to live.
They were evil.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:56.680
I swiftly implemented justice, that's all.

00:17:58.410 --> 00:17:59.820
I'm sure you understand,

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:01.340
Genos...

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.650
You've been busy since the exam.

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:06.440
But from what I saw of
the Deep Sea King incident and today,

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:09.790
you've mostly been a disappointment.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:14.380
Pay no heed.{Best leave it.}

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.460
Do not worry. I am fine.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.580
He reminds me of how
I was before I met Master.

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:23.520
A man on edge...

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:26.230
too eager to eliminate evil.

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:27.620
Just like me,

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.950
he must have gone through
something terrible in his past.

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:33.400
Wait!

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:34.580
Where is Master Saitama?

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.780
Oh, I'm out!

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:51.310
Hey!

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:54.710
Why would a Class B like you be inside the ship?

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:55.550
Master!

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:58.000
You are safe!

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.370
Hey, Genos!

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:00.900
We're done here. Let's go.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.910
Did you defeat their leader?

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.620
Yeah, he was really strong.

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:07.130
Maybe the strongest I've faced.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.150
I see.

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:11.050
So without you, Master,
the prophecy...

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:14.100
about the earth's destruction would have come true.

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:14.430
They're ignoring me?

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:14.680
Nah.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:18.020
Turns out you can't trust
prophecies to begin with.

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.840
Hold it right there!

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:23.510
I don't know how you did it,
but you went in the ship on your own?

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.690
You're just a Class B.
How dare you butt in like that?

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:28.320
I didn't need you. I could
have handled it on my own.

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:30.910
- Baldy! Octopus! Boiled egg!
Light bulb! Avocado!

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:32.490
- Lame face! Goblin! Bug! Baldy!

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:32.560
G-Genos.

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:33.900
- Ping-pong ball! Rice grain! Beanhead!

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:33.900
Say something.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.610
- Kettle! Baldy! Kneecap!

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:34.690
- Yes, sir.

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:36.840
Listen, spoiled brat.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.690
Shut up and get lost,
or get beat down.

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:40.830
That's it! Yeah!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.780
Unforgiveable. Me, a brat?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.440
I'm older than you!

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:49.480
Genos?!

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:51.930
You're next, Class B!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:53.560
Cut it out, Tornado.

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:57.590
You're part of the Association—
a hero, right?

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:01.000
Well, whatever.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:06.650
Why are there so many troublemakers
amongst the elite heroes?

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:10.440
Genos... Your joints are all bent
the wrong way.

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:12.000
Wait, let me fix you up.{Here, I'll fix you up.}

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:14.520
Oh sorry, your arm came off!

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:16.790
My back is killing me.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:22.870
City A was wiped off the map that day.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.210
The arrival of aliens and

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:28.090
City A's annihilation were history-making events,

00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:29.800
the top stories for days.

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:32.580
But eventually the coverage died down

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:35.840
and no one mentioned the
city that had disappeared.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:40.370
Metal Knight salvaged the spaceship.

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.680
Soon thereafter, the Hero Association headquarters

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:45.080
was reconstructed all the stronger,

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:47.470
and became an impenetrable fortress of steel.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:52.820
The infrastructure was rebuilt
with new roads leading out of HQ.

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:56.270
Heroes were able to deploy quickly to every city.

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:59.460
And heroes Class A and
above were given the option

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:02.390
to live at headquarters.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:14.840
Ashita e no kaze ni notte kanashimi tachi wo dakishimete

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:14.840
Riding a wind heading for tomorrow,
we cling to our many sorrows

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:25.830
Daijoubu sukoshi yasumou soshite mata susumou

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:25.830
It's alright, let's just rest a bit.
Then let's move forward again.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:37.460
Sekai wa mawari tsudzukete yagate kienu itami wo shiru

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:37.460
The world will keep on spinning, until we eventually
come to know the pain that won't ever fade.

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:43.500
Sore demo ima me wo tojite

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:43.500
Nonetheless, we close our eyes

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:50.130
Omoi de ga hohoemi ni kawaru

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:50.130
And our memories will become smiles

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:55.780
kibou ga sore wo kanaeru

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:55.780
Our hopes allow it to be so

00:21:56.820 --> 00:22:07.340
Itsunomanika hi ga kata mukeba nemuri ni tsutsumarete

00:21:56.820 --> 00:22:07.340
And when the sun begins to suddenly
wane, we're enveloped by sleep.

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:14.100
Omoi de yo hohoemi ni kaware

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:14.100
Oh memories, turn to smiles!

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:23.510
deaeta yorokobi dake Taisetsu ni shimattara

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:23.510
Once we've carefully stashed away
only the happiness of our meeting,

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:35.630
sayonara sotto te wo furu yo

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:35.630
We'll say, 'Goodbye'... and
wave our hands tenderly in parting.

00:22:42.720 --> 00:22:43.860
You can see it clearly!

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:46.740
The entire building has been
ripped out down to the foundations.

00:22:47.100 --> 00:22:51.240
The monster appeared in
City Z, but now City Y is in—

00:22:59.240 --> 00:23:02.200
PLUTON, KING OF THE UNDERWORLD

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:07.710
THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:11.710
You humans waste your existence in gluttony,

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:14.720
littering the earth with worthless objects.

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:18.300
Now shall you boil and rot
in the depths of the underworld

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:19.820
that spreads below my mighty snout!

00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:24.520
Who do we have here?

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:28.820
A great man who is a hero for fun...

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:31.100
and profit.

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:33.230
A great man?

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:42.870
And...his disciple.

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:52.620
Back to one punch again...

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:56.630
GOD DAMN IT!!
